source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The pair is the token's last run so Jira breaks there, and the `??` behind it closes nothing; jiro reads a hard break and keeps the question marks as text.
-- input.jira --
??ab\\??
-- rendered.html --
<p>??ab<br class="atl-forced-newline" />??</p>
-- want.md --
??ab\
??
-- warnings.json --
[]
